          "id": "7fd59e85dca74664",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 0,
          "text": "BANBA CURRENT-MODE CORE\nGF180MCU · 3.3 V · target about 0.6 V"
        },
        {
          "id": "3b6da13c9b134a9d",
          "x": 430,
          "y": 0,
          "text": "Equal branch currents, VA = VB.\nQ2 has eight identical PNP units.\nRCA and RCB must stay matched."
        },
        {
          "id": "59a3a98024264142",
          "x": 820,
          "y": 0,
          "text": "Starting sizes; not yet PVT qualified.\nMirror W/L = 8/4 µm; poly W = 1 µm.\nAll bodies/substrates explicitly tied."
        },
        {
          "id": "3bee8cd44dd34fd0",
          "x": 920,
          "y": 735,
          "text": "Ibranch ≈ VBE/RCA + ΔVBE/RPTAT\nVREF ≈ ROUT × Ibranch\nΔVBE ≈ VT × ln(8)\n\nScreened sizes: 100k / 11k / 50k.\nUse model results for actual values."
        }
      ],
